\par
It is recommended these two example shortcuts be copied to become\f1  templates of\f0  the new shortcuts\f1  \f0 and then modified to match the intended new file.  This will cause most of the\f1  \f0 settings to be either set properly or be fairly close.  Note: The copies must have\f1  \f0 the Read-only attribute removed to change anything; when done, set the Read-only\f1  \f0 attribute as described above.  Do not attempt any of these changes unless the\f1  \f0 %PDP-8_DRIVE% environment variable is already set and the current profile has been\f1  \f0 completely logged off at least once [or the system is rebooted].\par
