\par
directory to avoid clutter in the main Command window.  The other shortcuts in the\f1  \f0 Command directory can be studied in case additional utilities are contemplated.  The\f1  \f0 examples here are oriented towards adding a new project file to the working copy of\f1  \f0 the \f1 P?S \f0 Advanced SIMH PDP-8 simulator package.  The other provided shortcuts and\f1  \f0 underlying batch files [if relevant] are a sufficient set of utilities for most\f1  \f0 users; studying the existent files should be an adequate guide to\f1  \f0 anyone wishing to\f1  \f0 implement additional capabilities.  A thorough working knowledge of Windows batch\f1  \f0 files and directories is\f1  \f0 recommended before proceeding as there are nuanced issues\f1  \f0 that need to be addressed for a successful addition to this package.\par
