\cf0\f0 Internally, the P?S/8 SHELL overlay will provide an environment analogous to what\f1  \f0 OS/8 provides to a system program.\f1   \f0 No attempt at absolute compatibility is\f1  \f0 to be implied here; analogous methods will be used to avoid limitations of OS/8\f1  \f0 locked into the original design.  However, adapting OS/8 system programs to the\f1  \f0 SHELL environment will be relatively straight-forward; it is expected that each and\f1  \f0 every useful OS/8 program will be ported to the P?S/8 SHELL environment eventually.\par
