Because the SHELL design is open-ended and will implement much of the familiar OS/8\f1  \f0 functionality [with the known quirks and limitations simply not present], the SHELL\f1  \f0 environment will be a complete logical replacement for OS/8 when completed; there\f1  \f0 will simply be no reason to run OS/8 as it will be inferior in most aspects and at\f1  \f0 best will be a poor second-rate system by comparison.  An important consideration is\par
