The P?S/8 SHELL may or may not appear in P?S/8 Version 9A; the primary effort is to clean up the code to implement many small changes that are prerequisite to adding the shell design.  In the interest of having a new cleaner implementation of the basic system, Version 9A may be the last P?S/8 release without the SHELL overlay; this will be decided some time in the future; as required, documentation of this package will be updated accordingly.\par
